    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law and chapter 419 of the laws of 1991, amending the local finance law and other laws relating to providing relief to local governments for certain mandated programs and services, in relation to local government borrowing practices and mandate relief",
    "basePrintNo": "S4954",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4954-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
